Description: Stub PdfViewerPrivateGlicSummarizeFunction to avoid glic dependency
 The pdf_viewer_private_api.cc references the glic (Google AI assistant)
 namespace which is not available in Debian builds. The Debian Chromium
 disable-ai.patch disables glic at the build level but does not stub this
 particular function. This patch removes the glic includes and replaces the
 full glic-dependent Run() body with a simple error return.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-04-10

